---
id: orange-cranberry-almond-overnight-oats
title: Orange, Cranberry & Almond Overnight Oats
category: breakfast

yield:
  servings: 1
  cooked_g: 370

storage:
  fridge_days: 2
  freezer_friendly: false

---

In a jar or bowl, combine @rolled-oats{1/3%cup}, @chia-seeds{1%tbsp}, and @frozen-cranberries{1/2%cup} straight from the freezer.

Stir @orange-marmalade-fruit-sweetened{1%tbsp} into @partly-skimmed-milk-2pct{1%cup}, pour it in, and stir well so the marmalade dissolves (keep the opened jar in the fridge) and the chia doesn't clump. Cover and refrigerate overnight ~chill{8%hour}; the cranberries thaw and soften in the milk.

In the morning, warm in the #microwave for ~reheat{2%minute} until hot. Stir, top with @sliced-almonds{2%tbsp}, and serve.
